    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The galloping horse strength Gu, green bull labor Gu, and the other strength Gu Fang Yuan uses then are only rank three, set against Ju Kai Bei’s rank four dragon-elephant huge strength Gu. After Stone Turtle Strength Gu, Fang Yuan used white elephant primeval strength Gu and black python coiling strength Gu to gain those later phantoms.",
        "chapters": [
          317
        ],
